        <title>Scientists finally know how we make saliva</title>
        <meta name="title" content="Scientists finally know how we make saliva" />
        <meta name="description" content="Researchers have discovered how saliva, which is very important for our digestion and health, is made. They predict that in the future, a saliva test may become as common as a blood test when you see your doctor." />
